WEBVTT

01:25.080 --> 01:26.720
ADAPTED FROM THE LEGEND
OF KUNSHAN JADE BY TAN TIANYIN

03:01.000 --> 03:01.960
Not bad at all.

03:20.600 --> 03:22.480
In the rising tower,
jade pendants sway in the breeze,

03:24.120 --> 03:27.200
while pearls glisten
under the stars.

04:17.839 --> 04:20.600
-Wonderful!
-Bravo!

04:28.200 --> 04:29.920
Presenting today's highlight,

04:31.200 --> 04:32.520
a blood-stained Tridacna pearl.

04:33.040 --> 04:35.520
It wards off all evil
and weighs five maces.

04:36.120 --> 04:37.480
Its starting bid is three million maces.

04:38.000 --> 04:40.200
Tridacna pearls are precious.

04:40.280 --> 04:42.480
What does she mean by "blood-stained"?

04:42.560 --> 04:45.840
This pearl hostess
speaks not a word of truth.

04:47.200 --> 04:50.840
Pearl hunting is tough,
and so is selling them.

04:52.360 --> 04:53.960
Mr. Zhang, you're truly a kind soul.

04:59.000 --> 05:01.560
Mr. Peng, with your confidence
and grandeur,

05:01.640 --> 05:03.920
this treasure should go to you.

05:04.600 --> 05:06.520
Mr. Peng, are you interested in bidding?

05:06.600 --> 05:08.640
A blood-stained Tridacna pearl
is indeed rare.

05:08.720 --> 05:11.000
I'll offer two million maces.

05:11.080 --> 05:13.000
The starting bid is three million maces.

05:13.080 --> 05:15.360
Surely you jest, Mr. Peng.

05:16.280 --> 05:20.040
Steward Cui, what Mr. Peng means
is that this pearl is flawless,

05:20.120 --> 05:21.840
and he's willing to raise the bid
by two million.

05:22.880 --> 05:23.920
Isn't that right, Mr. Peng?

05:24.000 --> 05:25.600
I see.

05:26.640 --> 05:28.080
Thank you, Mr. Peng.

05:29.920 --> 05:31.000
Thank you, Master Yan.

05:31.880 --> 05:35.120
However, this pearl isn't flawless.

05:36.280 --> 05:37.480
Are you talking down your own item?

05:37.560 --> 05:38.760
It has an extraordinary flaw,

05:38.840 --> 05:40.120
the blood from a living person.

05:40.800 --> 05:42.840
I obtained this pearl myself,

05:42.920 --> 05:45.720
and the wound from gathering it
won't heal.

05:46.440 --> 05:48.080
As I said,

05:49.120 --> 05:50.560
a Tridacna pearl, tainted with blood,

05:51.080 --> 05:52.320
wards off all evil.

05:53.280 --> 05:54.840
That's what makes this pearl so precious.

05:54.920 --> 05:56.560
Tridacna pearls are rare for sure,

05:56.640 --> 05:58.400
but can they really ward off evil
after being tainted with blood?

05:58.480 --> 06:00.040
-Exactly.
-It sounds made up.

06:00.120 --> 06:02.520
I've brought you here
to see this pearl auction as promised.

06:02.600 --> 06:03.840
Now, about our wager…

06:05.200 --> 06:07.360
I was indeed overconfident.

06:09.160 --> 06:10.480
Mr. Zhang, you're truly
a man of your word.

06:12.520 --> 06:15.200
I'm not really keen on this pearl,

06:15.720 --> 06:17.640
but this box

06:18.480 --> 06:20.520
isn't something ordinary folks own.

06:21.280 --> 06:22.160
Thanks a lot.

06:25.000 --> 06:27.720
Since you're so gracious, in return,

06:28.760 --> 06:30.760
I'll help you lend a hand
to that pearl hostess.

06:31.920 --> 06:33.960
The Tridacna pearl is one
of the seven treasures of Buddhism.

06:34.480 --> 06:36.480
An ordinary Tridacna pearl is ominous.

06:37.000 --> 06:38.440
Gathering it brings misfortune.

06:38.520 --> 06:40.240
But if it bears human blood,

06:40.760 --> 06:42.120
it gains the power to ward off evil

06:42.200 --> 06:44.280
and can truly be called a talisman pearl.

06:44.360 --> 06:45.880
I am willing to bid

06:46.960 --> 06:49.120
-six million maces.
-Six million maces?

06:49.720 --> 06:51.640
However rare it is,
it can't be worth that much.

06:51.720 --> 06:54.200
Exactly.
No one's ever bid this high before.

06:54.280 --> 06:56.000
What? Can it really ward off evil?

06:56.640 --> 06:57.800
Can it really repel all harm?

06:58.400 --> 06:59.880
-Can it?
-Really?

07:01.200 --> 07:02.920
Even if it could,
it's still not worth six million maces.

07:20.080 --> 07:21.320
Take the offer while you can.

07:27.280 --> 07:28.320
Thank you for your kindness, sir.

07:31.080 --> 07:32.360
But I'm wagering my life here,

07:34.080 --> 07:35.240
not just a pearl.

07:49.320 --> 07:50.760
Only six million maces?

07:52.480 --> 07:55.960
Master Yan, such a price hardly honors
this one-of-a-kind treasure,

07:56.040 --> 07:56.880
the Mermaid's Tear.

07:58.400 --> 07:59.520
Steward Cui,

07:59.600 --> 08:02.480
this pearl hostess of yours
is full of lies.

08:02.560 --> 08:05.320
One moment it's a talisman pearl,
and now it becomes the Mermaid's Tear?

08:06.960 --> 08:08.320
In "In Search of the Supernatural",

08:09.000 --> 08:11.040
it's said there are merfolk
beyond the South Sea,

08:11.720 --> 08:13.480
living like fish in the water
and weaving tirelessly.

08:14.560 --> 08:15.840
When they cry,

08:16.360 --> 08:17.360
their tears become pearls.

08:25.480 --> 08:27.720
Everyone, Master Yan is an esteemed guest
from the State of Kang.

08:28.720 --> 08:30.200
Since he has bid six million maces,

08:31.480 --> 08:33.600
-this pearl should go to Yan--
-Steward Cui!

08:33.679 --> 08:36.320
When the mermaid cries,
her tears turn into pearls.

08:37.520 --> 08:40.000
A Mermaid's Tear is worth a life.

08:52.520 --> 08:53.360
Mr. Zhang.

08:56.680 --> 08:58.600
I ask you to appraise it.

09:02.440 --> 09:04.360
Sell it for seven million,
and you're free.

09:04.440 --> 09:06.280
If you fail, you will die.

09:14.920 --> 09:17.120
If this pearl is so precious,

09:18.600 --> 09:19.960
then I bid

09:21.680 --> 09:22.520
seven million maces.

09:23.840 --> 09:25.320
Seven million?

09:26.440 --> 09:28.400
Even if it wards off all evil,
that's too high!

09:28.480 --> 09:29.720
Mr. Zhang,

09:29.800 --> 09:32.520
seven million maces is no small sum.

09:35.640 --> 09:36.560
Thank you, sir!

09:46.560 --> 09:50.000
This pearl, bid at seven million
by Mr. Zhang,

09:50.080 --> 09:51.480
now belongs to him!

10:10.800 --> 10:13.200
This gold willow leaf isn't something
an ordinary person can possess.

10:14.760 --> 10:15.680
It seems I was presumptuous.

10:25.560 --> 10:26.400
Steward Cui,

10:28.000 --> 10:29.080
I hope

10:30.000 --> 10:31.120
you'll keep your word.

10:35.360 --> 10:39.160
Revealing his identity so easily,
he's unfit for bigger responsibilities.

10:40.680 --> 10:43.640
It's precisely his sincerity
and kindness that makes him

10:44.160 --> 10:45.400
trustworthy for this task.

10:45.920 --> 10:47.880
Shall we continue
with the original plan, then?

10:48.400 --> 10:51.000
Yes. By the way,

10:52.720 --> 10:54.320
just now, I saw a woman

10:54.920 --> 10:57.600
with a scar on her face. Find her for me.

10:59.120 --> 11:01.720
-An old acquaintance?
-Yes.

11:05.640 --> 11:06.800
Mr. Zhang.

11:11.400 --> 11:14.160
Greetings, sir. I'm Duanwu, a pearl diver.

11:14.240 --> 11:15.080
Thank you, sir.

11:15.160 --> 11:16.240
Duanwu?

11:18.840 --> 11:20.360
As in early midsummer.

11:20.440 --> 11:22.080
It's a fine name.

11:26.920 --> 11:27.840
In early midsummer,

11:28.360 --> 11:30.600
the Seven Mansions of the Azure Dragon
rise to the southern sky,

11:30.680 --> 11:32.480
reaching the centermost position.

11:33.240 --> 11:34.120
I didn't know that.

11:34.200 --> 11:37.160
Mr. Zhang, I came here to thank you

11:37.240 --> 11:38.880
and express my gratitude.

11:38.960 --> 11:40.240
Your kindness means the world to me.

11:41.600 --> 11:42.680
It was just a small gesture.

11:43.480 --> 11:46.640
To you, sir, it may have been,

11:48.120 --> 11:50.960
but to me, it's of great significance.

11:52.680 --> 11:54.080
Please don't misunderstand me.

11:54.600 --> 11:57.680
I only want to say
that if you ever need my help,

11:57.760 --> 12:00.120
I'll be there, no matter what it takes.

12:01.880 --> 12:04.000
Then I'll look forward
to your assistance someday.

12:04.520 --> 12:06.640
-Until we meet again.
-Until we meet again.

12:13.560 --> 12:14.400
By the way…

12:19.320 --> 12:20.720
this is actually my first time here.

12:21.600 --> 12:23.720
Would you mind showing me around Hepu?

12:26.280 --> 12:29.080
-If it's an inconvenience, never mind.
-That's not what I mean.

12:29.160 --> 12:32.280
But to be honest, Mr. Zhang,
I've never been to Hepu myself.

12:32.800 --> 12:34.600
As a pearl diver, I wasn't allowed
to leave the pearl farm.

12:36.360 --> 12:37.640
You've never left the pearl farm?

12:42.080 --> 12:42.920
Well, in that case,

12:43.680 --> 12:45.800
why don't you show me around
the pearl farm instead?

12:45.880 --> 12:47.760
Already getting cozy, those two.

12:49.640 --> 12:51.360
Are you happy about winning the bet?

12:52.120 --> 12:53.880
Of course.
Now, I can finally leave the pearl farm.

12:53.960 --> 12:54.920
So, what are your plans for the future?

12:57.240 --> 12:59.880
I plan to take a close friend with me,
leave Hepu,

13:00.720 --> 13:01.880
and sell goods while traveling.

13:03.240 --> 13:04.120
Just a small-time peddler?

13:04.200 --> 13:07.880
No, a free and unrestrained
grand merchant.

13:10.840 --> 13:13.000
Will Steward Cui give you a hard time?

13:14.200 --> 13:15.160
I'll be careful.

13:20.160 --> 13:23.240
By the way, Mr. Zhang, where are you from?

13:23.840 --> 13:24.680
Me?

13:25.720 --> 13:28.160
-Chang'an.
-The faraway Chang'an?

13:28.240 --> 13:30.480
Three thousand li from here.

13:31.360 --> 13:32.440
What's it like in Chang'an?

13:33.360 --> 13:34.600
You've asked the right person.

13:35.760 --> 13:36.800
In Banzheng Ward,

13:36.880 --> 13:38.720
shops are filled
with countless books and ancient texts.

13:38.800 --> 13:42.240
And in Fuxing Ward,
you'll find the best-baked flatbread.

13:42.320 --> 13:43.400
Baked flatbread?

13:44.160 --> 13:47.480
If you ever go to Chang'an,
you must try the water basin mutton there.

13:48.760 --> 13:50.320
In the West Market, you'll see Hu people

13:50.920 --> 13:52.360
with high noses and deep-set eyes,

13:52.920 --> 13:53.960
and Hu women are all skilled
at singing and dancing.

13:54.960 --> 13:57.160
Oh, there's also this local custom.

13:57.240 --> 13:59.880
We write our wishes on a wooden plaque

13:59.960 --> 14:02.360
and hang it on a blessing tree.
This way, the wishes will come true.

14:02.440 --> 14:03.960
What does a blessing tree look like?

14:07.880 --> 14:10.640
-Unfortunately, there isn't one here.
-Of course not.

14:12.960 --> 14:14.080
No worries.

14:14.800 --> 14:16.800
Sincerity is all that matters. How about

14:17.560 --> 14:18.400
we use this tree right here?

14:22.760 --> 14:25.280
Come on. What's your wish?

14:37.320 --> 14:38.160
Freedom.

14:40.080 --> 14:41.800
I want freedom.

14:46.080 --> 14:46.920
Alright.

15:05.440 --> 15:06.600
"Freedom."

15:12.120 --> 15:13.800
-Is that all?
-Make your wish first.

15:14.320 --> 15:15.240
Then I'll put the plaque up there for you.

15:31.680 --> 15:32.960
Thank you, Mr. Zhang.

15:39.320 --> 15:40.760
FREEDOM

15:40.840 --> 15:43.320
May your heart stay as clear as a mirror,

15:44.080 --> 15:45.480
and may all your wishes come true.

16:00.280 --> 16:01.120
Steward Cui.

16:03.600 --> 16:04.680
Master Yan?

16:10.840 --> 16:13.640
What brings you here so late at night?

16:14.480 --> 16:16.160
I'm here for my 15-mm pearls, of course.

16:17.960 --> 16:19.560
-You may go.
-Yes, sir.

16:26.200 --> 16:27.320
The goods are ready.

16:27.400 --> 16:29.240
But didn't we agree
to complete the deal tomorrow?

16:30.000 --> 16:31.600
I need to leave tonight.

16:31.680 --> 16:32.720
So,

16:33.480 --> 16:34.400
let's settle it now.

16:34.480 --> 16:36.440
Why the sudden rush?

16:41.240 --> 16:42.960
Steward Cui, don't play dumb.

16:43.600 --> 16:45.280
Gold willow leaves aren't something
ordinary folks can possess.

16:45.360 --> 16:46.360
You should know that.

16:46.440 --> 16:47.840
Otherwise, you wouldn't

16:47.920 --> 16:49.880
still be here at this hour,
waiting for news.

16:52.040 --> 16:53.520
I can also tell you

16:53.600 --> 16:56.600
that Prince Ying's sworn brother left
the capital and headed south recently.

16:57.120 --> 16:59.840
Although he's just
a scholar at Xiuwen Pavilion,

16:59.920 --> 17:01.720
it's said he's highly trusted
by both Prince Ying

17:02.240 --> 17:04.040
and the Emperor.

17:04.119 --> 17:05.319
What's more,

17:06.160 --> 17:07.000
his surname is Zhang.

17:09.599 --> 17:10.680
Is he the man from today's?

17:11.880 --> 17:15.280
I didn't say anything.
I'm just a businessman.

17:15.800 --> 17:18.880
To me, what matters most
are money and safety.

17:18.960 --> 17:20.520
But you brought him here.

17:21.560 --> 17:22.839
What are you talking about?

17:22.920 --> 17:24.480
Mr. Peng was on that ship too.

17:24.560 --> 17:25.920
I only found out
about this myself recently.

17:26.599 --> 17:29.720
I've also heard that Prince Ying

17:30.520 --> 17:32.640
and Prince Tan
are in fierce conflict these days.

17:33.240 --> 17:35.840
Your family has always
served Prince Tan, hasn't it?

17:46.120 --> 17:49.840
Besides the 15-mm pearls, I'll also take

17:51.560 --> 17:54.960
all the remaining pearls

17:55.040 --> 17:56.360
from the pearl auction.

18:04.200 --> 18:05.680
You think you can buy

18:06.840 --> 18:08.640
all the pearls in the Pearl Tower
with just this bit of gold?

18:13.520 --> 18:16.880
Steward Cui, who else but I

18:17.480 --> 18:19.560
would dare buy your pearls now?

18:21.360 --> 18:23.760
The quantity of the tribute pearls
has already been submitted.

18:24.280 --> 18:26.560
Yet Cui's Pearl Farm
still has this much stock.

18:26.640 --> 18:27.760
Does that seem reasonable?

18:28.400 --> 18:29.640
Besides,

18:30.600 --> 18:34.040
selling tribute pearls privately
is a capital offense.

18:35.640 --> 18:37.400
-This…
-Moreover,

18:37.480 --> 18:39.280
I know more about what's happening
in Chang'an than you do.

18:39.800 --> 18:42.560
Recently, many unfamiliar faces
have shown up in Hepu.

18:42.640 --> 18:43.560
You know that, right?

18:44.120 --> 18:46.520
As for their identities,

18:47.120 --> 18:47.960
they're easy to find out.

18:49.360 --> 18:51.120
If Prince Ying is really
looking into this,

18:51.200 --> 18:53.320
I'm not sure if Prince Tan
will be implicated,

18:53.840 --> 18:56.160
but the Cui family will probably
end up as the scapegoat.

19:08.240 --> 19:09.880
Come with me to get the goods.

19:13.440 --> 19:15.560
You actually sold the pearls
at such a low price?

19:15.640 --> 19:17.560
How dare you!

19:17.640 --> 19:19.880
Mr. Peng, given the current situation,

19:19.960 --> 19:22.040
it's wise to trade pearls for gold.

19:22.560 --> 19:23.640
I know

19:23.720 --> 19:26.840
the profits from the pearl auction
are meant for Prince Tan's big plans,

19:26.920 --> 19:28.760
but safety comes first.

19:29.280 --> 19:30.960
We control the entire sea around Hepu,

19:31.480 --> 19:33.960
and we'll have pearl divers
for generations to come.

19:34.040 --> 19:36.720
We can collect
as many pearls as we want in the future.

19:37.400 --> 19:41.280
Mr. Peng,
you're an invaluable aide to Prince Tan.

19:41.880 --> 19:44.200
Caution is what keeps us thriving.

19:49.160 --> 19:53.320
It's an honor for my family
to have Prince Tan's trust.

19:54.800 --> 19:57.800
As long as the court doesn't question
the quantity of the tribute pearls,

19:57.880 --> 19:59.760
we'll still be able to make a fortune.

20:00.400 --> 20:01.400
Please don't be upset, Mr. Peng.

20:01.480 --> 20:04.400
Shall I send over
that pearl hostess from the auction?

20:08.240 --> 20:10.000
I'll make the arrangements.

20:14.320 --> 20:17.720
Have Lady Eight dress up Duanwu
and bring her here.

20:18.400 --> 20:21.880
-But that Mr. Zhang said…
-I agreed to let her go,

20:21.960 --> 20:24.160
but what Mr. Peng does is out of my hands.

20:25.440 --> 20:27.640
By the way, tell her

20:27.720 --> 20:29.160
Mr. Zhang is here waiting for her.

20:39.920 --> 20:40.920
Duanwu!

20:41.680 --> 20:42.560
Listen,

20:42.640 --> 20:45.080
I got the Manumission Documents.
We'll leave in two…

20:45.160 --> 20:47.600
No, tomorrow. We'll leave tomorrow.

20:48.640 --> 20:50.560
-Alright.
-Duanwu.

20:50.640 --> 20:51.760
Come with me.

20:54.120 --> 20:55.400
I promise I'll get you out of here.

21:27.240 --> 21:28.600
What's this about?

21:29.600 --> 21:31.680
Mr. Zhang and his people
are leaving tomorrow.

21:31.760 --> 21:33.240
He said he needed to talk to you.

21:38.400 --> 21:39.920
I've seen Mr. Zhang.

21:40.800 --> 21:41.960
He didn't mention anything about this.

21:42.040 --> 21:44.480
Don't ask questions when you shouldn't!

21:45.120 --> 21:47.440
You must always be fully prepared.

21:47.520 --> 21:51.000
Some things can be useful
when the time is right.

21:52.880 --> 21:55.360
That Mr. Zhang
is obviously a well-read man.

21:55.440 --> 21:57.600
He's gentle, polite, and poised.

21:57.680 --> 22:00.520
You'd better keep your temper in check
in front of him.

22:00.600 --> 22:01.680
Don't offend this important guest.

22:03.480 --> 22:04.400
Understood.

22:05.360 --> 22:06.200
Go on.

22:13.840 --> 22:15.440
Go up there on your own.

22:23.120 --> 22:26.120
Lala, serve me well,

22:26.200 --> 22:28.920
and there'll be plenty of rewards for you.

22:32.200 --> 22:33.240
Lala!

22:36.880 --> 22:38.600
You're finally here.

22:39.120 --> 22:40.560
Duan… Duanwu.

22:43.800 --> 22:46.360
-Duanwu, don't blame me!
-Let's go.

22:46.440 --> 22:47.920
-Let's go!
-I didn't want this to happen!

22:48.000 --> 22:49.200
-Come with me!
-The man who got

22:49.280 --> 22:51.400
the Manumission Document is dead.

22:52.360 --> 22:53.840
There's no way out for us.

22:54.600 --> 22:56.360
-Come with me.
-Lala,

22:56.440 --> 22:58.440
convince her to join us,

22:58.520 --> 23:00.400
and I'll take both of you to Chang'an.

23:00.480 --> 23:02.720
Let's go!

23:03.280 --> 23:05.880
Little pearl hostess,
you do have some charm.

23:05.960 --> 23:08.880
Serve me, and you'll have a good life.

23:10.320 --> 23:11.360
Come on. Stop resisting.

23:15.840 --> 23:17.080
You cheap slave!

23:20.360 --> 23:22.040
How dare you, a harlot,

23:22.120 --> 23:24.560
hit me?

23:40.560 --> 23:42.760
Die!

23:57.720 --> 24:00.440
Quick! Kill this insolent slave!

24:01.360 --> 24:04.360
You wretch, how dare you offend Mr. Peng!

24:07.160 --> 24:08.400
Someone's killed!

24:08.480 --> 24:11.720
Someone's killed!

24:19.040 --> 24:20.600
Hurry. Come with me.

24:21.120 --> 24:22.840
Come on. Let's go!

24:22.920 --> 24:24.080
Let's go, now!

24:29.600 --> 24:32.080
Help!

24:32.760 --> 24:34.640
Someone's dead!

24:36.000 --> 24:37.720
-Hurry.
-What happened? Why the panic?

24:37.800 --> 24:39.200
Sir, Peng… Peng Wu is dead.

24:39.280 --> 24:40.960
-What?
-Duanwu killed him.

24:41.040 --> 24:42.120
Lady Eight is helping her escape!

24:42.200 --> 24:43.400
-Go after them!
-Yes, sir!

24:43.480 --> 24:44.400
Hold on.

24:45.080 --> 24:46.320
Kill them on sight.

24:46.400 --> 24:47.280
-Understood.
-I'm coming with you.

24:48.120 --> 24:49.160
Let's go that way!

24:49.240 --> 24:50.920
-Don't let them get away!
-Hurry.

24:51.000 --> 24:52.200
Get over here!

24:55.920 --> 24:57.920
-There's movement here!
-Duanwu!

24:59.840 --> 25:00.840
No one's here.

25:01.360 --> 25:02.960
Let's check over there.

25:04.640 --> 25:05.480
Come on.

25:15.080 --> 25:17.480
Everything is set.
They're waiting for your command.

25:17.560 --> 25:19.840
-Have you found her?
-Yes.

25:19.920 --> 25:21.000
She's an Accountant on the farm

25:21.080 --> 25:22.440
and also keeps the books.
Her name is Lady Eight.

25:22.520 --> 25:23.960
Bring back a ledger,

25:24.520 --> 25:25.360
and bring her back too.

25:46.040 --> 25:48.280
Father!

25:49.400 --> 25:50.920
Father!

26:03.440 --> 26:04.480
PEARL TOWER

26:08.680 --> 26:10.160
Fire!

26:10.240 --> 26:12.400
-Come put out the fire!
-Come on. This way.

26:12.480 --> 26:13.560
Come put out the fire!

26:13.640 --> 26:15.640
-Hurry and put out the fire!
-No.

26:15.720 --> 26:17.240
-Over here!
-Let's go that way!

26:17.320 --> 26:18.800
There!

26:18.880 --> 26:19.720
Stop right there!

26:19.800 --> 26:20.680
Stop running! Hurry.

26:20.760 --> 26:24.360
I didn't kill him.

26:24.440 --> 26:26.880
Duanwu did!

26:28.800 --> 26:31.640
Everyone's just looking out
for themselves.

26:31.720 --> 26:34.000
-Duanwu, you're no different!
-Let's go. Come on!

26:34.080 --> 26:35.880
-Duanwu!
-If you don't leave, you'll die here too!

26:49.720 --> 26:51.320
It was a nice building.

26:51.400 --> 26:53.120
It's a shame to see it burn.

26:54.760 --> 26:56.360
Everything the Cui family has touched

26:56.920 --> 26:57.760
is tainted.

27:03.640 --> 27:08.080
PEARL TOWER

27:12.640 --> 27:13.840
-Stop right there!
-Stop running!

27:13.920 --> 27:15.600
-Stop!
-Over there!

27:17.240 --> 27:18.080
Come back!

27:18.720 --> 27:20.480
They're over there! Go after them!

27:20.560 --> 27:22.440
-Let's go!
-Hurry.

27:23.440 --> 27:24.400
-Freeze!
-Come on!

27:24.480 --> 27:25.160
Stop right there!

27:25.240 --> 27:27.280
-Freeze! Stop running!
-Don't run!

27:27.360 --> 27:29.240
Stop right there!

27:29.320 --> 27:31.280
Freeze! Stop!

27:31.840 --> 27:33.560
-Stop!
-Stop running!

27:33.640 --> 27:35.040
Stop! Stop running!

27:35.120 --> 27:36.240
Freeze!

27:36.320 --> 27:37.160
Come on.

27:37.240 --> 27:38.760
-That way. Let's go!
-Stop running!

27:38.840 --> 27:39.960
Hurry!

27:40.640 --> 27:43.280
-Stop them!
-This way!

27:43.360 --> 27:44.280
-Stop!
-Come on!

27:44.360 --> 27:45.720
Don't let them escape!

27:46.280 --> 27:47.360
This way!

27:47.440 --> 27:48.280
Freeze!

27:49.680 --> 27:51.560
-Hurry!
-Stop her!

27:51.640 --> 27:52.640
Hurry up!

27:52.720 --> 27:53.800
Faster!

27:55.360 --> 27:56.480
The boat's here. Get on!

27:57.080 --> 27:58.280
Why are you helping me?

27:58.800 --> 28:00.200
Because I'm your mother!

28:04.880 --> 28:07.000
Now go. Hurry!

28:10.320 --> 28:13.840
Wait. What did you say?
I don't understand.

28:13.920 --> 28:15.960
-Wait!
-Get on the boat, now!

28:16.040 --> 28:17.120
Just do as I say!

28:17.200 --> 28:19.320
What trick are you trying to pull?

28:23.680 --> 28:24.680
Sweetheart,

28:26.440 --> 28:27.480
I really am your mother.

28:28.360 --> 28:29.840
Your adoptive father's surname is Wei.

28:30.360 --> 28:32.560
He later had a daughter named Xiazhi.

28:32.640 --> 28:34.840
Before you were taken to the pearl farm,

28:35.360 --> 28:37.120
you were supposed to leave with them.

28:37.200 --> 28:38.360
I arranged everything

28:39.200 --> 28:41.000
so they could take you away,

28:41.520 --> 28:44.400
but you were still captured
and brought to the farm.

28:45.520 --> 28:47.560
It's an honor to be a pearl diver.

28:47.640 --> 28:48.560
You'll have food, drink,
and a comfortable life.

28:48.640 --> 28:50.800
What more do you want? Take her away!

28:51.960 --> 28:53.800
I tried everything I could

28:54.320 --> 28:57.480
to help you escape, but nothing worked.

29:00.840 --> 29:02.200
My dear daughter,

29:03.360 --> 29:05.200
it's my fault.

29:06.880 --> 29:10.600
This was the only way I could protect you.

29:13.320 --> 29:14.160
Sweetheart,

29:15.920 --> 29:17.520
I'm so sorry.

29:17.600 --> 29:19.120
My dear daughter…

29:27.880 --> 29:29.560
-Stop there!
-Come on!

29:29.640 --> 29:30.800
Don't leave!

29:30.880 --> 29:32.320
Stop right there!

29:32.400 --> 29:33.240
Hurry!

29:34.440 --> 29:35.480
Hurry!

29:36.680 --> 29:38.240
This was left by your father.

29:38.880 --> 29:41.040
Keep it safe, and go find him
in the Western Regions.

29:41.120 --> 29:43.560
Remember, sweetheart,
go to the Western Regions to find him.

29:44.280 --> 29:45.880
-Shrimp, hurry.
-Duanwu.

29:45.960 --> 29:47.400
Get your sister out of here.

29:47.480 --> 29:49.040
-Duanwu.
-I'll hold them off.

29:49.120 --> 29:51.800
-Let's go, Duanwu!
-Wait!

29:51.880 --> 29:54.000
Wait! Hold on!

29:54.080 --> 29:55.680
Come with me.

29:55.760 --> 30:01.160
Come with me!

30:01.240 --> 30:04.000
-I'll hold them off.
-Come with me!

30:04.080 --> 30:08.200
-I'll hold them off!
-Come with me.

30:08.720 --> 30:10.640
Come with me.

30:12.320 --> 30:13.560
Come with me.

30:14.080 --> 30:16.840
If you don't go now, it'll be too late.

30:18.240 --> 30:19.840
Come with me, please.

30:20.600 --> 30:22.880
Alright,

30:23.400 --> 30:24.880
I'll go with you.

30:25.400 --> 30:26.400
I'll go with you.

30:26.920 --> 30:28.200
-Let's go.
-Hurry!

30:28.280 --> 30:29.280
They're up ahead!

30:29.360 --> 30:30.960
-Stop them!
-Hurry!

30:31.040 --> 30:32.640
-Stop them!
-Stop right there!

30:32.720 --> 30:35.160
-Duanwu, hurry!
-Duanwu!

30:35.240 --> 30:36.800
-Come on!
-Stop them!

30:36.880 --> 30:37.800
-Hurry!
-Catch her!

30:37.880 --> 30:39.200
Over there!

30:41.880 --> 30:43.520
-Stop right there!
-Hurry!

30:43.600 --> 30:44.440
Stop!

30:44.520 --> 30:46.240
Hurry, Shrimp! Row the boat!

30:46.320 --> 30:47.560
Hurry!

30:48.120 --> 30:49.080
Hurry!

30:50.400 --> 30:51.280
Hurry!

30:51.360 --> 30:53.840
Row the boat, Shrimp!

30:53.920 --> 30:55.480
They're right over there!

30:55.560 --> 30:58.240
-Leave! Go! Go now!
-Stop there!

31:17.720 --> 31:18.800
My dear daughter,

31:19.640 --> 31:21.120
survive.

31:22.120 --> 31:24.080
You must survive.

31:28.320 --> 31:29.680
Don't go.

31:46.240 --> 31:48.720
Yu, I'm not leaving.

31:49.320 --> 31:51.440
-If I leave, you're coming with me.
-You're pregnant.

31:51.520 --> 31:52.680
Return to Hepu first.

31:52.760 --> 31:54.080
I wonder if the master and the others are…

31:54.160 --> 31:56.040
They'll be fine.

31:56.120 --> 31:57.520
You must take care of our child.

31:57.600 --> 31:59.360
Yu!

32:00.720 --> 32:01.880
Steward Yan has returned.

32:01.960 --> 32:02.880
He said everyone
in the Yan family had died

32:02.960 --> 32:04.400
and that the Cui family
owned the pearl farm now.

32:04.480 --> 32:06.200
What should we do, Lady Yan?

32:07.200 --> 32:09.960
Lady Yan! Are you alright, Lady Yan?

32:18.720 --> 32:20.080
Listen up!

32:20.160 --> 32:22.560
This pearl farm
now belongs to the Cui family!

32:22.640 --> 32:23.720
Defy us,

32:24.600 --> 32:25.600
and you'll end up like this!

32:25.680 --> 32:27.200
Do you hear me?

32:31.920 --> 32:34.440
Lady Yan, why did you do this?

32:35.400 --> 32:36.920
This is the only way

32:38.000 --> 32:40.760
I can bring her into this world safely

32:41.840 --> 32:43.560
and protect her.

32:45.040 --> 32:46.960
I don't want her to end up a pearl diver.

32:47.480 --> 32:49.440
She was born on the fifth day
of the fifth month.

32:49.960 --> 32:51.200
I'll name her Duanwu.

32:51.800 --> 32:54.280
Please,
promise me you'll take good care of her.

32:54.360 --> 32:56.360
-Rest assured.
-Rest assured.

32:58.080 --> 32:59.200
Duanwu.

32:59.280 --> 33:00.280
Duanwu.

33:04.480 --> 33:05.320
Your name?

33:05.840 --> 33:08.200
My name is Zhaohua.

33:10.000 --> 33:11.680
Your name? Speak up!

33:12.720 --> 33:14.720
My… My name is Duanwu.

34:13.199 --> 34:15.000
The pearl… Duanwu,

34:15.080 --> 34:18.159
I think someone picked up the pearl
Lady Eight gave you!

34:29.480 --> 34:30.520
Let's go.

34:50.800 --> 34:52.320
The ledger has been delivered.

34:53.400 --> 34:55.719
This pearl farm in Hepu
is a den of filth and corruption.

34:56.639 --> 34:57.640
This ledger

34:58.160 --> 35:00.240
should make a fine gift for Prince Ying.

35:00.320 --> 35:03.120
Prince Ying and Prince Tan
are locked in fierce conflict.

35:03.200 --> 35:04.760
If Zhang Jinran could truly expose

35:04.840 --> 35:06.320
Prince Tan's embezzlement
of the tribute pearls,

35:06.400 --> 35:09.440
the Cui family would be doomed.

35:09.520 --> 35:10.920
This is just the beginning.

35:12.280 --> 35:14.000
Did you find the person
I asked you to locate?

35:14.080 --> 35:15.080
Not yet.

35:17.120 --> 35:19.360
Leave two people here to keep looking.

35:19.440 --> 35:20.440
Understood.

35:24.360 --> 35:25.800
Is the illness acting up again?

35:33.760 --> 35:34.600
It's nothing.

35:36.600 --> 35:37.560
Put it out!

35:38.560 --> 35:40.040
Hurry. Get more people to help!

35:40.120 --> 35:41.240
-Yes, sir.
-Hurry!

35:42.720 --> 35:44.400
Duanwu didn't start this fire.

35:44.480 --> 35:46.960
The Pearl Tower and the pearl farm
caught fire at the same time.

35:47.040 --> 35:48.600
Someone must have planned this in advance.

35:48.680 --> 35:50.120
-There's more fire over there!
-How are the books?

35:50.200 --> 35:52.000
The counting house burned down.

35:52.080 --> 35:54.400
The account books
are probably all destroyed.

35:54.480 --> 35:55.320
Good.

35:56.640 --> 35:57.480
It's better they're burned.

35:57.560 --> 35:59.400
How should we explain this to the master?

35:59.920 --> 36:02.120
Steward Cui,

36:02.640 --> 36:04.240
Master Shijiu's ship is about to dock.

36:04.320 --> 36:05.360
What's she doing here?

36:05.440 --> 36:07.520
Could she be here for her dowry?

36:07.600 --> 36:11.920
That girl
always dresses like a man.

36:12.000 --> 36:13.840
I doubt she's here for a dowry.

36:14.720 --> 36:16.200
She's here to deal with me!

36:16.280 --> 36:19.840
CUI

36:19.920 --> 36:21.920
This year, the farm
produced 43 Qizhen pearls

36:22.000 --> 36:23.000
and 2.3 sheng of small pearls.

36:23.080 --> 36:25.080
Among the tribute pearls, there are
ten Qizhen and nine Babao pearls.

36:25.160 --> 36:27.320
We also have 5.3 sheng of smooth pearls
and 11.2 sheng of rolling pearls.

36:27.400 --> 36:28.480
-Altogether--
-I recall

36:29.240 --> 36:32.600
that last year, we had 56 Qizhen pearls
and three sheng of small pearls.

36:32.680 --> 36:35.240
Among the tribute pearls, there were
12 Qizhen pearls and 12 Babao pearls.

36:35.760 --> 36:37.920
Why is there so much less this year?

36:41.840 --> 36:46.240
LEDGER

36:48.720 --> 36:50.840
Cui Ding really treats Cui's Pearl Farm

36:50.920 --> 36:52.560
like it's his own,

36:53.440 --> 36:55.080
scheming at every turn.

37:00.000 --> 37:02.720
Master Shijiu, with so many merchants
attending the pearl auction,

37:02.800 --> 37:05.480
there isn't a dock available right now.

37:05.560 --> 37:07.240
I ask for your patience, sir.

37:07.320 --> 37:08.600
Outrageous!

37:08.680 --> 37:10.000
How dare you make my master wait?

37:10.080 --> 37:11.080
I wouldn't dare,

37:11.600 --> 37:13.320
-but…
-Just dock.

37:13.400 --> 37:15.040
Dock the ship.

37:15.120 --> 37:17.440
But there are small boats everywhere.

37:17.520 --> 37:20.400
Sink anyone who stands in the way.
I don't care if they live or die.

37:20.480 --> 37:24.880
Get moving. Stop bothering my master.

37:24.960 --> 37:26.360
Why are you still standing here?

37:26.440 --> 37:28.200
Hurry up and do it, now!

37:50.480 --> 37:51.640
Duanwu!

37:52.360 --> 37:53.880
We're safe, Duanwu!

37:58.680 --> 38:01.680
Wake up, Duanwu!

38:03.040 --> 38:04.120
Duanwu?

38:08.120 --> 38:09.000
Hold it here.

38:09.080 --> 38:10.760
Move this finger down.

38:10.840 --> 38:12.320
Yes, grip it tightly here.

38:12.400 --> 38:13.880
Lower your hand a bit.

38:16.240 --> 38:19.040
Sit up straight. Relax your shoulders.

38:20.200 --> 38:22.840
You moved it there again.
You made the same old mistake.

38:22.920 --> 38:25.040
How many times have I told you?
Should you have moved it here?

38:26.880 --> 38:28.120
Three ge from the old stock,

38:28.200 --> 38:29.360
plus three ge newly collected.

38:29.440 --> 38:31.160
What's the total?

38:43.520 --> 38:44.760
You are lucky

38:44.840 --> 38:45.800
to come back alive.

38:45.880 --> 38:47.080
Have the medicine.

38:56.360 --> 38:57.720
You must always be fully prepared.

38:58.320 --> 39:01.880
Some things can be useful
when the time is right.

39:28.560 --> 39:29.400
Who sent this?

39:29.480 --> 39:33.000
When we were rushing to escape the fire,
someone bumped into me.

39:33.080 --> 39:34.800
Later, I found this ledger in my bag.

39:35.400 --> 39:38.640
This ledger
details the pearl farm's harvest,

39:38.720 --> 39:40.480
but it's vastly different
from the tribute pearl records.

39:40.560 --> 39:42.240
What should we do next?

39:45.480 --> 39:48.400
We have material evidence
but no witnesses.

39:49.840 --> 39:51.560
Anyone could've written these accounts.

39:52.160 --> 39:53.400
Now that the Pearl Tower is destroyed,

39:53.480 --> 39:55.440
the pearl farm could use this opportunity
to cover up their crime.

39:55.520 --> 39:58.560
Cui Ding has probably
figured out your identity, sir.

40:00.000 --> 40:01.280
Who could be pocketing the money

40:02.480 --> 40:03.720
from the private sale of tribute pearls?

40:03.800 --> 40:05.120
I doubt Cui's Pearl Farm

40:05.200 --> 40:06.880
would have the nerve
to commit this crime alone.

40:08.160 --> 40:10.240
Cui Ding is definitely a key player.

40:11.640 --> 40:13.000
Keep a close watch on Cui's Pearl Farm.

40:13.080 --> 40:14.200
Yes, sir.

40:21.440 --> 40:23.200
That ship is heading straight
for the docks,

40:23.280 --> 40:24.600
and there's a small boat in its path.

40:25.640 --> 40:26.720
This is not good.

40:29.200 --> 40:32.240
Duanwu, wake up! A ship's coming our way!

40:32.320 --> 40:34.000
Stay back! There's a boat here!

40:34.600 --> 40:37.320
Duanwu, wake up!

40:37.400 --> 40:38.720
Don't come any closer!

40:38.800 --> 40:39.640
CUI

40:40.240 --> 40:43.000
Stay back!

40:43.080 --> 40:44.160
Duanwu!

40:44.240 --> 40:45.760
Stay away!

40:52.480 --> 40:54.040
Help!

40:54.560 --> 40:56.480
-Is anyone there?
-Someone's fallen overboard.

40:56.560 --> 40:58.160
-Du Ming, rescue them!
-Help!

40:58.240 --> 40:59.400
Yes, sir.

41:29.320 --> 41:30.440
Greetings, Lady Shijiu.

41:30.520 --> 41:31.800
Outrageous!

41:31.880 --> 41:34.400
How dare you
keep Master Shijiu waiting this long?

41:35.520 --> 41:37.680
Master Shijiu, welcome to Hepu.

41:38.320 --> 41:40.160
Please forgive me for being late.

41:41.120 --> 41:43.320
I heard you'd be getting married soon.

41:43.400 --> 41:46.080
Have you come to prepare your dowry?

41:52.960 --> 41:55.320
I see that you're here
on behalf of the master, Master Shijiu.

41:55.400 --> 41:58.080
Are this year's tribute pearls ready?

42:00.200 --> 42:03.960
They were all prepared
and stored in the Pearl Tower.

42:04.040 --> 42:05.640
But there was a terrible fire today,

42:05.720 --> 42:07.680
and now the Pearl Tower
is nothing but rubble.

42:08.280 --> 42:09.920
It was truly a man-made disaster.

42:10.440 --> 42:12.360
There was a defiant slave
on the pearl farm named Duanwu.

42:12.440 --> 42:14.600
She secretly seduced Peng Wu,

42:14.680 --> 42:17.720
and somehow, she not only killed him

42:17.800 --> 42:20.640
but also colluded with Lady Eight
to burn down the entire Pearl Tower!

42:20.720 --> 42:23.960
May I ask, Steward Cui,
have you caught them?

42:24.040 --> 42:25.120
We're working on it.

42:26.040 --> 42:28.200
Once Duanwu is caught,
everything will come to light.

42:30.880 --> 42:33.240
I don't care about the truth.

42:34.080 --> 42:36.960
Not a single pearl can be missing.

42:37.040 --> 42:39.400
But how could I possibly
get so many pearls now?

42:40.000 --> 42:41.880
Even if we have to cut you up
and sell the pieces,

42:41.960 --> 42:43.600
the job must be done.

42:43.680 --> 42:45.240
Otherwise,

42:46.520 --> 42:48.960
I'll throw you into the ocean
to feed the sharks.

42:49.480 --> 42:51.240
Would you prefer that, Steward Cui?

42:53.120 --> 42:56.120
Sir, there's a problem with the gold leaf.

42:56.200 --> 42:57.280
It's fake.

43:07.360 --> 43:08.560
This was left by your father.

43:08.640 --> 43:10.000
Go find him in the Western Regions.

43:12.320 --> 43:13.960
Duanwu, you're awake!

43:14.040 --> 43:15.440
You finally woke up!

43:16.720 --> 43:17.880
Duanwu, we've made it.

43:17.960 --> 43:19.680
Mr. Zhang saved us.

43:19.760 --> 43:21.480
We're on his ship now.

43:21.560 --> 43:22.760
He said he knew you.

43:25.400 --> 43:26.800
Duanwu, come on.

43:28.160 --> 43:29.000
Drink this.

43:30.440 --> 43:31.280
By the way, Duanwu,

43:33.720 --> 43:35.160
Lady Eight left this for you.

43:35.680 --> 43:37.640
She was the one who told me
to wait for you by the shore.
